flowchart TD
  cmd[An approved shell command] --> where{Where is it running?}
  where -- macOS or Linux desktop --> ready{Sandbox ready?}
  where -- anywhere else --> open[Runs unsandboxed, and says so]
  ready -- yes --> fenced[Runs in the sandbox]
  ready -- no --> refuse[Refused, with the reason]
  click ready href "https://github.com/seandearnaley/brainstrike/blob/main/docs/agents/code-execution.md" "Code execution contract"
  click fenced href "https://github.com/seandearnaley/brainstrike/blob/main/docs/agents/code-execution.md" "Code execution contract"
  click open href "https://github.com/seandearnaley/brainstrike/blob/main/docs/agents/code-execution.md" "Code execution contract"
